{"4553290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Road From Horno", "steam_appid": 4553290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/2dd4b1451b20390835aedd6cb738f911.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/2dd4b1451b20390835aedd6cb738f911.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road From Horno</strong> is a tactical narrative shooter where precision, stealth, and tactical decision-making are essential to survive as you fight to protect the people you once hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/33767877e5dfd383eabd26811eb6b3fd.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/33767877e5dfd383eabd26811eb6b3fd.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=409 /></span><strong> </strong>Combat where only well-placed headshots stop the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/0cff3b5dd21abcf1cde50b700e248157.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/0cff3b5dd21abcf1cde50b700e248157.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=391 /></span><strong> </strong>Hostile environments using positioning and tactical awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/1b532e9970fa6bbfd0765c63e48b063c.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/1b532e9970fa6bbfd0765c63e48b063c.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=443 /></span>Abandoned locations to uncover evidence, survivor stories, and the truth behind the collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/9d0f926602ad7f367d06f08e4baabff3.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/9d0f926602ad7f367d06f08e4baabff3.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=386 /></span> Civilians through high-stakes missions that reinforce Lucas's journey from persecutor to protector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/b126dbeaf23b767f6324b660e2e8536f.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/b126dbeaf23b767f6324b660e2e8536f.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=396 /></span>Escalating mutant threats that demand discipline, adaptability, and tactical execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/ee012ec0af3305da92816c02bd94fe4a.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/ee012ec0af3305da92816c02bd94fe4a.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=441 /></span>A story-driven campaign where every mission advances Lucas's authored redemption arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/1d63472f0470343e011f33e79e6abcbf.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/1d63472f0470343e011f33e79e6abcbf.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=389 /></span> A dystopian world shaped by corporate corruption, resistance movements, and the fight for survival. <br> <br>Road From Horno is currently in pre-alpha, running on Build v0.1, with three playable levels and a fourth now in production. Players can explore story-driven environments, fight infected, complete objectives, collect story items, and follow Lucas’s journey. Some animations, UI elements, enemy balancing, and environmental assets are still being refined. We’re currently improving weapon feel, enemy behavior, level pacing, and narrative delivery. Our next milestone is completing Level 4 and preparing the game for wider playtesting and community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/2dd4b1451b20390835aedd6cb738f911.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras_big/2dd4b1451b20390835aedd6cb738f911.webp?t=1788072594 width=1560 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road From Horno</strong> is a tactical narrative shooter where precision, stealth, and tactical decision-making are essential to survive as you fight to protect the people you once hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553290/extras/33767877e5dfd383eabd26811eb6b3fd.avif?t=1788072594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps